{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "战略大会冻结原创之争  (Clashing Over Freezing Original Shows)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Xingtian's annual executive strategy summit, right after a rule threatens a one-month salary fine for mentioning the previous administration, Xie Ling unveils his plan to freeze all domestic original shows. Listen to Xie Ling and Bu Xiaogu clash in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "关于我到任以后星天娱乐的未来发展方向，我的团队已经有完整规划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我与海外三大电视台和经纪公司，都有着非常紧密的合作关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "一流的引进版权加上豪华的国际明星阵容，我能让它马上在星天落地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "所以我认为当务之急，是要把公司当下三个本土原创节目全部冻结掉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，谢先生，您这个方案是提出来讨论的，还是宣布结果的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当然是拿出来讨论的嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我不认识你们，出道多久了？在哪个电视台待过？做过什么节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢先生，我从美国回来就一直在星天，倒是您在星天待几天呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "姑娘，既然待了这么久，看来你对董事长的心思还是不太了解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要的是本土原创。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我来告诉你，董事长的目标是高质量、高产出、多赚钱！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长就坐在这儿，您还是别揣摩圣意了，我和您一样就是个制作人。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "关于我到任以后星天娱乐的未来发展方向，我的团队已经有完整规划。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Regarding Xingtian Entertainment's future direction under my leadership, my team already has a complete plan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我与海外三大电视台和经纪公司，都有着非常紧密的合作关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I maintain very close partnerships with three major overseas networks and talent agencies.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "一流的引进版权加上豪华的国际明星阵容，我能让它马上在星天落地。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'First-rate imported format rights paired with an all-star international lineup can land at Xingtian right away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "所以我认为当务之急，是要把公司当下三个本土原创节目全部冻结掉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Therefore, I believe our urgent priority is to freeze all three of the company's current domestic original projects.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，谢先生，您这个方案是提出来讨论的，还是宣布结果的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on, Mr Xie—is this proposal being tabled for discussion, or are you announcing a fait accompli?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当然是拿出来讨论的嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Naturally it is being put forward for discussion.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我不认识你们，出道多久了？在哪个电视台待过？做过什么节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not recognize your faces—how long have you been in the field, which stations have you worked at, and what shows have you made?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢先生，我从美国回来就一直在星天，倒是您在星天待几天呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xie, I have been at Xingtian ever since returning from America—how many days have you been at Xingtian?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "姑娘，既然待了这么久，看来你对董事长的心思还是不太了解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Young lady, despite being here so long, it seems you still do not understand what the chairwoman really wants.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要的是本土原创。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What the chairwoman wants is domestic original programming.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我来告诉你，董事长的目标是高质量、高产出、多赚钱！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you: the chairwoman's goal is high quality, high output, and making more money!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长就坐在这儿，您还是别揣摩圣意了，我和您一样就是个制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chairwoman is sitting right here, so stop trying to read the sovereign's mind; like you, I am simply a producer.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "关于我到任以后星天娱乐的未来发展方向，我的团队已经有完整规划。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我与海外三大电视台和经纪公司，都有着非常紧密的合作关系。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "一流的引进版权加上豪华的国际明星阵容，我能让它马上在星天落地。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "所以我认为当务之急，是要把公司当下三个本土原创节目全部冻结掉。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "等一下，谢先生，您这个方案是提出来讨论的，还是宣布结果的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "当然是拿出来讨论的嘛。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我不认识你们，出道多久了？在哪个电视台待过？做过什么节目吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢先生，我从美国回来就一直在星天，倒是您在星天待几天呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "姑娘，既然待了这么久，看来你对董事长的心思还是不太了解。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长要的是本土原创。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我来告诉你，董事长的目标是高质量、高产出、多赚钱！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长就坐在这儿，您还是别揣摩圣意了，我和您一样就是个制作人。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to let Xie Ling lecture her on what Xingtian's chairwoman truly values, Xiaogu calmly puts him in his place right across the boardroom table. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
